      "text": "TOP\nTRAIN\nBUS\nOUTING\nINFORMATION\nCOMPANY\nINFORMATION\nACCESS SIGHTSEEING INFORMATION SERVICES TOURIST ATTRACTIONS DISCOUNT TICKETS \nLANGUAGE\n \nTrain Status Information \n\nCurrently the train is running on schedule.\n\n1\n2\n3\nACCESS\n \nSIGHTSEEING INFORMATION SERVICES\n \nTOURIST ATTRACTIONS\n \nDISCOUNT TICKETS\nMEANS OF TRANSPORTATION IN THE ENODEN AREA\nHow to buy tickets\nHow to buy tickets\nAIRPORT BUS INFORMATION\nTOURIST ATTRACTIONS ALONG ENODEN LINE\nENOSHIMA\nAREA\n\nEnjoy visiting an aquarium with views of Mount Fuji and walking on the bridge that crosses the island of Enoshima.\n\nFor details, click here\nHASE\nAREA\n\nHighlights include Hasedera Temple, popular for its views of hydrangeas and the sea, and the Daibutsu, or Great Buddha, which is a national treasure.\n\nFor details, click here\nKAMAKURA\nAREA\n\nThe Kamakura area has many historical temples and shrines such as Tsurugaoka Hachimangu Shrine with its beautiful vermilion color and Kenchoji Temple with a giant gate.\n\nFor details, click here\nBaggage service\nSightseeing unencumbered by baggage!\nBaggage storage service\n9:00-17:00\nBag :¥300\nLuggage :¥600~¥800\nCoin locker information\nCurrency exchange and ATM information\nCurrency exchange / ATM\nTourist Information Center\nKamakura City Tourist Information Center\n9:00～17:00\nFujisawa City Tourist Information Center\n8:30～17:00\nShopping\nKOTO-NO-ICHI Kamakura\n10:00～19:00\nEnoden Kamakura Station premises\nPAGETOP\nRelated Links\nPrivacy Policy\n \n\nEnoshima Electric Railway Co., Ltd.\n\nCopyright © Enoshima Electric Railway Co. Ltd. All Rights Reserved.\n\nThis website uses cookies to provide better service to our customers. By using the service, you consent to the use of cookies.\n\nPrivacy Policy.\n\nAccept",
